WEBVTT

NOTE Machine translated from English captions; target=sw.

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.215
Sababu ya kuwachunguza mboni katika huduma ya msingi ya macho ni kuona kama kuna kitu chochote kinachoonekana

2
00:00:07.215 --> 00:00:14.431
ushahidi wa ugonjwa, kama vile mtoto wa jicho au kiwewe, na kuona kama mmboni inabana mwanga mkali.

3
00:00:14.431 --> 00:00:21.245
Hii inatuambia ikiwa neva ya macho au retina iliyo nyuma ya jicho ni nzuri.

4
00:00:21.245 --> 00:00:26.857
Anza kwa kueleza utakachofanya na angalia mgonjwa ana furaha.

5
00:00:26.857 --> 00:00:32.269
Kisha angalia macho ili kuona kama mboni ni weusi, mviringo na

6
00:00:32.269 --> 00:00:37.680
