24
00:01:35.480 --> 00:01:39.431
kuna uwezekano wa kuwa ugonjwa nyuma ya jicho na maono

25
00:01:39.431 --> 00:01:40.560
matokeo ya upasuaji wa cataract

26
00:01:40.560 --> 00:01:41.782
